# Claude Code local state — the curated skill-atlas files are re-included
# below (`.claude/*`, not `.claude/`: git cannot re-include anything under
# a directory ignored with a trailing-slash pattern).
.claude/*
!.claude/skill-atlas/
.claude/skill-atlas/*
!.claude/skill-atlas/.gitignore
!.claude/skill-atlas/categories.json
!.claude/skill-atlas/config.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/search-skill-test/
.claude/skills/search-skill-test/*
!.claude/skills/search-skill-test/SKILL.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# OS
.DS_Store
